@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Team Members of Organization

actor "User" as User
participant "OrganizationView" as OrgView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

User -> OrgView : 1 Open organization members page
activate OrgView
OrgView -> OrgView : 2 Display members list view

OrgView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request members info
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch members data
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve members records
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return members data
ClerkAuth -> OrgView : 7 Return members info
OrgView -> User : 8 Display members list

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate OrgView

@enduml
